      Ag     5.69362380     1.64360762    19.63544264
    &END COORD
    &KIND Ag
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q11
    &END KIND
    &KIND F
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-GTH
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q7
    &END KIND
    &KIND Li
